[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4750.229, "timestamp": "01:19:10", "text": "我的天啊。等等，我还活着。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4759.11, "timestamp": "01:19:19", "text": "为什么说是翻滚发射？我已经拿走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4761.11, "timestamp": "01:19:21", "text": "它。对不起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4764.149, "timestamp": "01:19:24", "text": "是呃吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4767.91, "timestamp": "01:19:27", "text": "我会努力推动这件事。不用担心。钢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4768.75, "timestamp": "01:19:28", "text": "好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4770.55, "timestamp": "01:19:30", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4772.149, "timestamp": "01:19:32", "text": "呃，顺便一提，既然你们俩都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4773.43, "timestamp": "01:19:33", "text": "健康状况极差，请记住"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4776.63, "timestamp": "01:19:36", "text": "毛刺。送我上去。给我寄一块。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4779.91, "timestamp": "01:19:39", "text": "请。我应该进行健康升级吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4782.83, "timestamp": "01:19:42", "text": "坚持，稍等。坚持，稍等。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4785.43, "timestamp": "01:19:45", "text": "想知道，你去哪儿了，罗科？我在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4788.63, "timestamp": "01:19:48", "text": "我在这里。好的。我给你准备了一个设备。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4791.43, "timestamp": "01:19:51", "text": "那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4793.23, "timestamp": "01:19:53", "text": "好的。看。调查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4794.83, "timestamp": "01:19:54", "text": "[音乐]"}]